  "premise": "Local reporter Maya Chen disappears hours before publishing evidence that redevelopment money was routed to a vendor controlled by a contractor executive. Her editor, Julia Reed, asks Maya’s trusted friend to follow Maya’s public trail, identify the vehicle used to take her, and give police a verified location in time for a safe rescue.",
